<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#24352d">
    <title>About Us | The Book Store</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/home.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/about.css">
</head>

<body class="about-page">
    <%- include('includes/nav.ejs') %>

    <main>
        <section class="about-hero">
            <div class="about-hero-copy">
                <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> A place for every reader</p>
                <h1>For the love<br>of a good <em>story.</em></h1>
                <p>We’re here for the pages that stay with you, the ideas that open new doors, and the joy of finding your next favorite book.</p>
                <a class="button button-gold" href="/books">Find your next read <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            </div>
            <div class="about-hero-image">
                <img src="/uploads/Sunlit Books and Olive Branch.png" alt="A warm, inviting view of our bookstore">
                <div class="about-image-label"><span>✳</span> OPEN A BOOK. OPEN A WORLD.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-hero-index">OUR STORY <span>—</span> 01</div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-story">
            <div class="story-aside"><span>THE BOOK STORE</span><span>EST. FOR READERS</span></div>
            <div class="story-copy">
                <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">A little about us</p>
                <h2>Books make the world<br>feel <em>bigger.</em></h2>
                <p>We believe a good book can be a window, a welcome escape, or the beginning of a brand-new idea. The Book Store brings together stories and knowledge from different shelves, so every reader can find something that speaks to them.</p>
                <p>Whether you’re here to learn, to dream, or simply to enjoy a quiet moment, we’re glad you found your way here. Take a look around. Your next chapter may be waiting.</p>
                <a class="story-link" href="/categories">Wander through the categories <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            </div>
            <div class="story-ornament" aria-hidden="true"><span>Read</span><i>✳</i><span>Wonder</span><i>✳</i><span>Repeat</span></div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-values">
            <div class="values-heading">
                <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">What we believe</p>
                <h2>Every reader<br>belongs <em>here.</em></h2>
            </div>
            <div class="values-grid">
                <article class="value-card">
                    <span class="value-number">01</span>
                    <span class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span>
                    <h3>Curiosity comes first</h3>
                    <p>Follow a question, a feeling, or a passing interest. There’s always something new to discover.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="value-card">
                    <span class="value-number">02</span>
                    <span class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
                    <h3>Stories are for everyone</h3>
                    <p>From practical ideas to faraway worlds, make space for the reads that feel right for you.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="value-card">
                    <span class="value-number">03</span>
                    <span class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">♡</span>
                    <h3>Take your time</h3>
                    <p>There’s no rush. Enjoy the search, linger on a page, and let a good story unfold.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-cta">
            <span class="cta-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
            <p class="eyebrow">Your next chapter is calling</p>
            <h2>Come find a story<br>to <em>take home.</em></h2>
            <a class="button button-light" href="/books">Explore the books <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="home-footer">
        <a href="/" class="footer-brand">The Book Store<span>Read. Learn. Grow.</span></a>
        <div class="footer-links"><a href="/books">Books</a><a href="/categories">Categories</a><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a></div>
        <span class="copyright">© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> The Book Store</span>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
